  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f21480015d6d73f61b4480b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "紧身裤啊，尾巴的洞经常对不上……\n这个我自己调整好了♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b4bb58de829089339579c1337a91c4e955cf1a715c0be6f61d11b0c1ba5d595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fddad3b1a83fc603bb4525c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "前几天我在电车上，\n被一个小宝宝抓住了尾巴……\n太可爱了，让我都不好意思了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "66233cbd70d54ce46934ebeae9269400230b64de9f16693f4e44ded9f687763d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8826ef6526cf9a57843dabf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿男装真的超开心！\n其实是我搞的惊喜恶作剧，\n下次要对谁来一次好呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "742aa079d94564c19fd25358b2b978feea9b00b23d9ce4748a0f2a9270aa2f7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec6e3cef369cc90187cb4b4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺能干的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b697a8f6e6ea5774d5ae60f3a693424ac41a2f02eb1d5e2471d8359d146e157",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:747ec09e6d3087d9a35ff2a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是通往未来的胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "798a586d70b7fcea13a1294fc71e9ea1f366ed9aacaee7a1fe489ad2a17a576d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8765ce351d8010e4c49684e9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……活用到未来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1fc51a3bf21bc30122f3f35cc2b6bdfcbdb216dc6055bd7d20d1538cc820cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3de85f2632fc4872d7ffd42a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "挺能干的嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b697a8f6e6ea5774d5ae60f3a693424ac41a2f02eb1d5e2471d8359d146e157",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:724863522f4f41a1e4268b28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刷新最高分了哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b286feb9a5690604777876da3f7c49d0f8ddc27e3bff8a35b49f2b601519858",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36653dae641d6b065eda5d51",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "——那么，走吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7e4a84f1ef26b5ae1716f4e13e6f249140c0ae3439ecc210682e9f04edd0959",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3ff0ebe925cc29b1a74eb87",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcbdb44c52c5fb4a0082c7c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哪怕是一点点，\n也让我们积累起来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd566dfdc23ba285889f7febdf68afba67a313a89bb23ef1771601623cf0cbb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6d156fcd7aeb666910af664",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有多少步就有多少历史……\n那每一步，都是构筑当下的基石呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a507913709f83fc6a310f1ca49463a81b7c37b29a02b093d03482bc704a863",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e21931d33fba004ccb2a11b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是比赛的报名呢。\n无论何处，我都将前往。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8efdd5f7cd4992d408007cbd618e4db0500344506a63b00ab828cd949687fc88",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:68734d21a74d0de6e2375a4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为基石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d2f3010bb0aab3424f00c4b22156fc7266667ef524e4683f79c6e0b76f998d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1199"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd65726878c0ce65d88eef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f159888e2df92336da3885cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以此力为基石……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6c0d6b395c5a38e46b19a8e0ead779215470e3ccfa32e6336bc8e1406b69bac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:029807ef91d36f81c7d718ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了闪耀的未来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8a453deffb6c712cc96f9577365381d3d78cfcbdfc9f7b3f2c6b50cade68a45",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d51536e739d49b142626cc91",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "总大将……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97c1da282229b0841ee68968dec739cf5ad0031471af5edcfd1594dca63de7f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "1212"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0d27d06e7d8df92f1fed7ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是今天的登录奖励哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7fa772fedd4cd388e54c0f88c7bc51981af744e27d9b487ea7f68d3e6c4693a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31ec22dfa0ff9216512697b9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能抓到哪个孩子呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "47dc4a9fe6211d1c58984b2e4fde224d9431ce32c3a912d7712c0e739dc660cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "140000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8584fb20952a6c905e60a607",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抓到了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e26f806ce5b34dbc6f210002b2dfe36eda3bec1064d66ebef206805e604993b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "140001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab32dae8a0fb083367657854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac77a8ecc7e7b8c5bf461c60a35dd1148a27380616ff2079039af4da0f60e468",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "140002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:445ebdcaef556438b46dea5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "抓到了好多呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbd2b65dbcfdeb2288eeca4b02f874363cefb23867d2bc19aa4882d304a9cb8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
        "140003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18f4e1e276602f02c5289cd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，哪个孩子都很可爱♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e87417d1c90b4652e633f2f861d002e96e3bbbf35c06f897aae8a412404f6ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1110",
